  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>L'Atelier De Croustille is a dog and cat grooming salon at 484 avenue Maréchal Lyautey, in Cavalaire-sur-Mer, for grooming your dog during your stay in the Gulf of Saint-Tropez. The salon is recent: its Facebook page celebrated "already 2 months of opening" in a post of 5 June, and its Instagram account shows posts from late March 2026, i.e. an opening in spring 2026.</p>

      <h2>Services and appointments</h2>
      <p>The salon's Instagram account lists cutting, clipping, plucking and brushing, and states that the salon works by appointment only: by phone on 07 83 55 77 71 or by private message on Instagram. Its highlighted stories are sorted into "large" and "small" dogs.The Gulf of Saint-Tropez tourist office lists the salon under animal services, open Monday to Saturday all year round.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Neither the Facebook page nor the Instagram account publishes hours, prices or admission conditions (size, weight, number of dogs): these points are settled by phone, before travelling. Google Maps shows Monday 2pm to 6pm, Tuesday to Friday 9am to 6pm and Saturday 9am to 2pm, closed on Sunday.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before travelling to find out prices, book a slot and check that your dog can be taken in.</div>
      <p><strong>Check before you go:</strong> the hours, not published by the salon itself, and the prices.</p>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The salon is on avenue Maréchal Lyautey, in Cavalaire-sur-Mer, in the Gulf of Saint-Tropez.</p>
